// Test: Cell interior mutability
// Spec: 04-MEMORY.md § 5.3 Interior Mutability
// Priority: P0 - Bootstrap Critical
//
// Purpose:
// Validates Cell allows mutation through shared reference.
//
// Expected behavior:
// Value changes via Cell get/set

rite main() {
    ≔ cell = Cell·new(5);
    println(cell.get());
    cell.set(10);
    println(cell.get());
    cell.set(cell.get() + 5);
    println(cell.get());
}
